# c143r2_model.py output (stdlib only, deterministic)
# arms: A = arm jia / yi for stat 12 (max over readable roots); AJ / AJ2 = + journal
# records (at rollback / every mount); G = clue: pool-wide number watermark in root and
# record headers; C = arm bing; CJ / CJ2 = + journal checkpoint_txg (rollback / every mount)
# fs = faults per slot (down disk 1, root slot 1, record copy 1); fr = record copies per range

